% Every entry here was checked against the publisher's own record. Two notes on
% what changed relative to the original 2025 submission's bibliography:
%
%   1. The 2007 PMF paper is by Mnih and Salakhutdinov, in that order. The
%      original submission cited it as "Salakhutdinov and Mnih" throughout and
%      keyed it `salakhutdinov2007probabilistic`. The key is kept as an alias
%      below so old references still resolve, but the author order is corrected.
%   2. The original submission cited `deng2023probabilistic`. No such work could
%      be located in any indexed venue, so it is not reproduced here; the claim
%      it supported (that matrix factorization is an effective model-based
%      collaborative-filtering method) is instead supported by Koren et al.

